---

import Container from '../../components/ui/Container.astro'

---

<section id="about" class="py-24 sm:py-32 border-t border-border">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">
          About
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl tracking-tight">
          Senior Engineer with a product mindset
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-5">
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
          I'm a senior mobile and fullstack engineer who has built products across fintech, 
          enterprise SaaS, and consumer mobile. I focus on scalable architecture, clean 
          abstractions, and systems that perform under real-world conditions.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
          My work ranges from leading frontend architecture at fintech companies processing 
          millions in transactions, to building full-stack mobile applications from the ground up, 
          to consulting with startups on architecture and product strategy.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
          I believe great engineering is about ownership — understanding the problem deeply, 
          making pragmatic tradeoffs, and delivering systems that are both robust and adaptable.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4">
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-4">
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted mb-1">Focus</p>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium">Full-Stack Architecture</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-4">
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted mb-1">Domain</p>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium">Fintech &amp; SaaS</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-4">
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted mb-1">Platform</p>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium">Web &amp; Mobile</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-4">
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted mb-1">Approach</p>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium">Product-Driven</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="#contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-foreground transition-all duration-200 hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-elevated"
          >
            Let's work together
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" />
              <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
